# consider, and through it fight.c's is_safe. Decimus (level 10, no clan) in the temple, with mobs put there at each
# step of the level difference: the fido (0), the beggar (1), the vagabond (5), a lumberjack (6, from another area;
# Midgaard's level-8 thief hides), the wolf (9), the secretary (12), the cityguard (15) and Hassan (45, already there).
@connect dec
Decimus
psswrd
@return
consider
consider zz
consider self
@mob 3062 3001
consider fido
@mob 3065 3001
consider beggar
@mob 3063 3001
consider vagabond
@mob 6000 3001
consider lumberjack
@mob 3094 3001
consider wolf
@mob 3142 3001
consider secretary
@mob 3060 3001
consider cityguard
consider hassan
# The mobs is_safe protects: a shopkeeper (the baker), a trainer (the sailor), a practicer (the guildmaster), a
# healer, a changer (Otho) and a pet (the eagle).
@mob 3001 3001
consider baker
@mob 3007 3001
consider sailor
@mob 3023 3001
consider guildmaster
@mob 3012 3001
consider healer
@mob 3162 3001
consider otho
@mob 3095 3001
consider eagle
# A safe room: By the Temple Altar (3054), north, with the healer who lives there. (A move lags its mover one
# pulse, so a pulse follows each.)
north
@pulse 1
consider healer
south
@pulse 1
# Players: Decimus has no clan. Clansman (20, rom) on Decimus (no clan), on Outlaw (18, a loner, but a KILLER and
# THIEF, so fair game) and on Yeoman (5, rom: more than 8 levels below). Smokegod, an immortal, may consider anyone.
@connect quin
Quintus
psswrd
@return
@as dec
consider quintus
@connect clan
Clansman
psswrd
@return
@connect out
Outlaw
psswrd
@return
@connect yeo
Yeoman
psswrd
@return
@as clan
consider decimus
consider outlaw
consider yeoman
@as yeo
consider clansman
@as out
consider yeoman
@connect god
Smokegod
smoke123
@return
@return
consider hassan
consider decimus
consider baker
